window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>England, 1964. Dorian Gray and the Hedonists are touring the country when they come up against a band of Rockers - The Gravediggers - led by the mysterious Otto. But what is the secret behind the rockers' experimental sound? And will the violence spreading across the country ever stop? </p><p>Note: <i>The Confessions of Dorian Gray</i> contains adult material and is not suitable for younger listeners. </p>"; 
